{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56924","headline":"天目山谶 · 佚名","name":"天目山谶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天目山前两乳长，龙飞凤舞到钱塘。\n海门一点巽山小，五百年间出帝王。\n（见宋钱俨《吴越备史》卷一、元刘一清《清塘遗事》卷一）（〖1〗《吴越备史》云此出郭璞《临安地志》，然此首平仄工稳，非郭璞之时所宜有，当出唐末人依托爲钱氏开国之谶。\n《銭塘遗事》：「临安都城，其山肇自天目，谶云〖略〗。\n钱氏有国世，臣事中朝，不欲其说之着，更其末云『异姓王』，以迁就之。\n高宗驻跸，其说始验。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56924.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56924","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}